[2026-06-27T10:00:00Z] Decision: Off-thread precompute triggered by vault change events
[2026-06-27T10:00:00Z] Decision: Immutable snapshots for safe concurrent access
[2026-06-27T10:00:00Z] Decision: Passive timing monitor for zero-overhead metrics
